    "subType": "classFeat",
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Engineer 10, Death Ray engineer trick</p><p>When the engineer fires his death ray, he can expend 2 of its daily uses to widen the beam, potentially catching multiple creatures in the 30-ft.-wide cone or 3 daily uses for a 60-ft.-wide cone. The ray no longer has a range increment and does not require a touch attack, but the creatures in the area of effect now receives a Reflex save (DC 10 +half of the engineer's level + his Intelligence modifier) to half this damage.</p>",
